  <data name="Nav_Conference" xml:space="preserve"><value>Conference</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_SofiaLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sofia 2026</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_AboutTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>About the Conference</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_AboutPara1" xml:space="preserve"><value>The rapid evolution of blockchain technologies and the cryptoeconomy has outpaced academic frameworks and inter-university coordination across Europe. Educational programs remain fragmented, varying in depth and lacking common quality criteria.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_AboutPara2" xml:space="preserve"><value>This international conference, organized by the Institute of Cryptoeconomics, Blockchain and Innovation (ICBI) at UNWE in partnership with the National Association for Blockchain and Innovation, creates a platform for systematic dialogue. Our goal is to unite academia, regulators, and industry in a shared space with a focus on quality education, research, and innovation.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_GoalsLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>GOALS</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_GoalsTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>What We Set Out to Achieve</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal1_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Establishing Academic Standards</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal1_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Discussion and adoption of the "Sofia Declaration on Academic Standards in Cryptoeconomics and Blockchain Education" — a binding framework for European universities.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal2_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Synchronise Curricula</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal2_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Modernising university models based on global trends and best practices from the EU, USA, and Asia — creating coherent, comparable educational pathways.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal3_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Adapt to Regulatory Frameworks</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal3_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>In-depth analysis of European regulations (MiCA) and their direct influence on academic training infrastructure and program content.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal4_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Build Academy–Industry Collaboration</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Goal4_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Establishing a sustainable international academic network and launching joint projects between higher education institutions and Web3 businesses.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_OutcomesLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>Expected Outcomes</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_DeliverablesTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Concrete Deliverables</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv1_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sofia Declaration</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv1_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Formal adoption of a landmark document defining shared academic standards for cryptoeconomics and blockchain education across Europe.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv2_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>International Network</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv2_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Establishing a sustainable, cross-border consortium of universities for ongoing research, faculty exchange, and joint European projects.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv3_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Curriculum Frameworks</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv3_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Delivering concrete models for modern university programs, integrating CHAISE and Erasmus+ frameworks, and establishing dedicated blockchain academic labs.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv4_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Knowledge Transfer</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Deliv4_Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>Laying the groundwork for strategic technology transfer and funded joint initiatives between higher education institutions and the Web3 sector.</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_ThemesLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>THEMES</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_ThemesTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Thematic Areas</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Theme1_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Education &amp; Academic Standards</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Theme2_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Regulatory Policies &amp; Law (MiCA)</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Theme3_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Web3 Technologies &amp; Tokenomics</value></data>
  <data name="Conf_Theme4_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Research &amp; Business Synergy</value></data>
